**Live baseline (2026-09-28):** expect **5–6% mean/day**, floor the old **4–6%**. Higher days are wanted; they are not the expect. A measured stretch on these belts (now +17.3%) is not the live ballpark. Do not juice a sim to print 5–6% on a quiet book or 17% as typical. Slippage / iceberg / size stay on the agenda — they are how a $2M book keeps that baseline.
